1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,920
Someone ate Gus's sandwich. Can you catch the thief?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,920
This morning, Gus painted every stair yellow.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,920
He left his sandwich up by the lamp, and shut every window.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,920
When he came back, it was gone.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,420
Three suspects.

6
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:18,170
Pip the seagull: "I was flying over the sea all morning."

7
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:21,670
Mabel the cat: "I napped downstairs all day."

8
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:25,420
Rollo the mouse: "I never climb stairs. I'm too small!"

9
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,420
Look closely. Who is lying?

10
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,167
Comment your answer!

11
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:35,920
Here's the clue.

12
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,670
The windows were shut, so nobody flew in.

13
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:41,170
The thief had to climb the wet stairs.

14
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:44,920
Mabel's paws are clean. Rollo's paws are yellow!

15
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,170
Rollo climbed. Rollo lied. Rollo ate the sandwich.

16
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:51,920
Did you spot it? Follow for the next riddle.
